---
import StrategyLab from "./StrategyLab.astro";
---
<section class="panel" data-panel="agent" hidden>
  <div class="switcher" data-switcher="agent" role="tablist">
    <button type="button" data-switch="strategies" aria-pressed="true"><i class="switcher__dot switcher__dot--butter"></i>Strategies</button>
    <button type="button" data-switch="agent" aria-pressed="false"><i class="switcher__dot switcher__dot--violet"></i>Agent</button>
  </div>
  <p class="bots-note">Deposit at least $10 before starting a bot. Hyperliquid's smallest order is $10, so a bot can't place a trade with less.</p>
  <div data-pane="agent:strategies"><StrategyLab /></div>
  <div data-pane="agent:agent" hidden>
  <div class="agent">
    <div class="agent__main">
      <form class="agent__composer" data-headline-form>
        <input
          type="text"
          data-headline-input
          autocomplete="off"
          maxlength="500"
          placeholder="Paste a headline: Oil jumps as talks stall"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" data-headline-go>Turn into a trade</button>
      </form>
      <p class="agent__hint" data-headline-hint></p>
      <div class="agent__result" data-headline-result></div>

      <form class="agent__composer" data-agent-form>
        <input
          type="text"
          data-agent-input
          autocomplete="off"
          placeholder="Describe a trade: long ETH short BTC 2x $100 stop 8%"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Draft</button>
      </form>
      <p class="agent__hint" data-agent-hint></p>
      <div class="chip-row" data-agent-ideas></div>

      <div class="agent__tools" data-agent-tools>
        <span class="panel__label">Analysis tools</span>
        <div data-tool-combo></div>
        <div class="agent__args" data-agent-args>
          <label class="field"><span>Market</span><input data-arg="symbol" value="BTC" /></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Long</span><input data-arg="long" value="ETH" /></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Short</span><input data-arg="short" value="BTC" /></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Days</span><input data-arg="days" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="7" /></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Order USD</span><input data-arg="notionalUsd" type="number" min="0" value="300" /></label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="agent__feed" data-agent-feed>
        <p class="empty">Run a tool or draft a trade. Everything the agent looks at appears here.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="agent__side">
      <aside class="agent__card card" data-agent-card>
        <span class="card__label">Strategy card</span>
        <p class="empty" data-card-empty>Draft a trade or pick an idea to build a card.</p>
        <div data-card-body hidden>
          <label class="field"><span>Name</span><input data-card-name /></label>
          <div class="agent__row">
            <label class="field"><span>Margin $</span><input data-card-margin type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label>
            <label class="field"><span>Stop %</span><input data-card-stop type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label>
            <label class="field"><span>Target %</span><input data-card-tp type="number" min="0" step="any" /></label>
          </div>
          <div data-card-legs class="agent__legs"></div>
          <button type="button" class="link-btn" data-card-add>+ Add leg</button>
          <div data-card-preview class="agent__preview"></div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-card-approve disabled>Open now with passkey</button>
          <div class="agent__botrow">
            <select data-card-mode aria-label="Bot mode">
              <option value="guard">Guard an open position</option>
              <option value="auto">Auto open and guard</option>
            </select>
            <button type="button" class="btn" data-card-bot>Run as bot</button>
          </div>
          <p class="status-line" data-card-status></p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <section class="card agent__bots">
        <span class="card__label">Your bots</span>
        <p class="bots__note">
          Bots run in this tab while you are signed in. Close it and they stop. Every action is logged with its
          transaction.
        </p>
        <p class="agent__hint" data-bot-hint></p>
        <div class="bots__list" data-paper-list></div>
        <div class="bots__list" data-bot-list>
          <p class="empty">No bots yet.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="card__label">Running on the server</span>
        <p class="agent__hint">These keep running while this tab is closed. They trade with a key that can place orders but cannot withdraw.</p>
        <div class="bots__list" data-server-bot-list></div>
        <span class="card__label">Live strategies</span>
        <p class="agent__hint">Lab strategies trading real orders on the server. Pause stops new orders and keeps the position and its exchange stop. Stop and close cancels its orders and closes at market.</p>
        <div class="live__switch">
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-live-stop-all>Pause all bots</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn" data-live-close-all>Stop all and close</button>
        </div>
        <div class="bots__list" data-live-bot-list></div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
